OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest after man
OL,4,Astabbed in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fattempted murder after a stabbing in
OL,8,FBlackpool.
OL,10,FIt happened at about 15:15 on Monday in
OL,11,Fthe Exchange Street and Cocker Street
OL,12,Fareas of the town, Lancashire Police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FFollowing an "altercation" involving
OL,16,Fthree men, one of them, aged in his
OL,17,F30s, was stabbed. He was taken to
OL,18,Fhospital for non life-threatening stab
OL,19,Fwounds, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
