OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest after man
OL,4,Astabbed in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice, including armed officers,
OL,7,Fattended the scene and a 22-year-old
OL,8,Fman was arrested on suspicion of
OL,9,Fattempted murder. He remains in
OL,10,Fcustody.
